-- =============================================================================
-- Dram — catalog seed data
-- =============================================================================
-- Purpose: populate public.distilleries, public.whiskeys and
--   public.whiskey_aliases with a broad set of real, well-known distilleries
--   and expressions so the app has a usable catalog to browse/search/rate
--   against in dev and demo environments.
--
-- Idempotency: this file is meant to be run once against an EMPTY catalog
--   (e.g. `supabase db reset`, which replays migrations then seeds). It does
--   not use `on conflict` because `distilleries` has no unique constraint on
--   name alone (only on normalize_text(name), country, which plain `insert`
--   cannot target with a column-list `on conflict`) — running it twice will
--   duplicate rows. All whiskey names in this file are unique.
-- =============================================================================

begin;

